RK: Yes. [PAUSES FOR 5 SECONDS] Let me just recollect my thoughts. [PAUSES FOR 11 SECONDS] We were in Milowce a short time, when-- [PAUSES FOR 4 SECONDS] when we had a order to leave. [PAUSES FOR 10 SECONDS] We had a order to leave. But we didn't know, till we went, we are going to leave. But a order was given.

