Those people who were hiding in the village, they were all slaughtered. They opened the well, threw the people in, closed the well, and ran away. What do you do now? What do you do now?

I will not sleep here. We were afraid to stay. Let's go. We went [INAUDIBLE]-- Milowce [NON-ENGLISH] means down the hill. [NON-ENGLISH], on a hill.

I said, I have a girlfriend, [NON-ENGLISH]. She survived the pogrom. I told you that her mouth was twisted. She went there. They sent her there and she remained.

